WEBVTT

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:44.770
Yeah!

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:47.650
Thank you, "it was all a dream" trope!

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:49.860
Ugh, how annoying!

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:55.280
Me, going to a different world?
What nonsense!

00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:00.500
What a nightmare that was.

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:07.960
I'm relieved.

00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:18.930
So hungry, where is meat?

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:19.100
BREAKING LIVE: Giant Creature Makes Landing

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:13.930
The unknown giant creature that
appeared in central Tokyo earlier today

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:19.100
is travelling northwest, destroying
mainly food storage sites on its path.

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:21.810
Wh-What in the...

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:23.980
Damage reports are coming in.

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:28.520
BREAKING LIVE: Giant Creature Makes Landing

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:28.730
This is quite serious...

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:30.940
It wasn't a dream...?

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:33.320
You have a visitor.

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:37.200
Mr. Ninomiya! We know
you're in there! Please come out!

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:42.040
I'm here now in front
of the apartment where

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:46.130
the man who is believed to have
some relation with the monster lives.

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:53.720
Come out and talk to us, Mr. Ninomiya!

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:57.890
Mr. Ninomiya, can you hear us?

00:01:55.340 --> 00:01:57.890
I-I don't know!

00:01:57.890 --> 00:01:59.890
I don't know anything!

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:03.060
Kinji... Found you.

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:09.900
I'm hungry, you know.

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:11.740
Rim...

00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:20.080
I'm hungry. I'm hungry. I'm hungry...

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:20.080
W-Wait, I...

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:32.920
O-Oh, a dream... Thank goodness.

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:36.130
You're awake, Lord Messiah.

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:37.340
Huh?

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:45.850
Please, could you save our world?

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:54.730
The Dungeon of Black Company

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:58.490
The Dungeon of Black Company

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:19.940
Episode 5

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:25.410
You... Unless I heard you wrong,
did you just ask me to save your world?

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:26.750
Yes...

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:29.370
I'm not catching on at all...

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:35.090
Before we address your crazy claim...
Where in the world am I?

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:37.840
Last I remember, I was in the dungeon.

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:40.510
Where's Shia? Where's Wanibe?

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:44.720
Where are the others who were with me?
Did you carry them away?

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:49.020
Well... That's...

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:54.440
Sorry, I forgot my lines! Oops!

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:57.280
One moment! Let me start over!

00:04:57.280 --> 00:05:00.860
The Book of Prophecies mentioned what
to do when this type of thing happened...

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:05.950
Let's see. If the Messiah is confused and
starts bombarding you with questions,

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:13.500
go with a begging look from the
right side for the best effect. I see.

00:05:15.590 --> 00:05:22.180
Lord Messiah... We, the human race,
are at the brink of extinction.

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:26.140
Please lend us your aid...

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:28.600
What is this charade...

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:35.400
Rim, I'll get you plenty
to eat later, so... Do it.

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:36.480
Yep.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:37.900
Huh?!

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.360
H-Hey!

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:46.160
Listen, what I want to know is...

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:46.160
Whoosh. Whoosh. Hit, hit.

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:47.950
Wha--?!

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:54.500
What is this place...?!

00:05:54.500 --> 00:06:00.590
Oh my, where are our manners?
Apologies, Lord Messiah.

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:09.890
I am Zazel. I am in charge
of this town, Marcia.

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:14.900
This is Ranga, our priestess.
Ranga is very skilled with magic, but...

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:21.030
Perhaps we were too lenient
with how we raised our protégé.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:27.870
I don't care about that.
Just explain the situation.

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:29.620
Yes, well...

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:32.580
Let me start from the beginning.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:35.080
It all started 300 years ago,

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:40.380
when a certain corporation brought
the world to the brink of collapse.

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:44.050
The company emerged as a coagulation
of the negatives of capitalism,

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:48.800
and grew extremely quickly by
using its employees like slaves.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:54.100
It effectively spread its destructive
ideals to the entire world.

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:55.730
Soon, dividing the population into

00:06:55.730 --> 00:07:00.440
the ruler class and the corporate
grunts became the norm.

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:04.570
The grunt class, a huge majority
of the population, stopped thinking.

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:08.370
The entire human race began
to weaken as a result.

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:12.540
As if to capitalize on that moment,
the "Demon Lord" appeared.

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:15.870
The Demon Lord used monsters
to rule the world.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:19.330
Defeated, we humans
escaped below the ground.

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:23.760
We have spent the past
300 years in this dark shelter.

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:26.220
During that time, our resources dried up,

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:30.510
and we don't even know
how much longer we can last.

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:32.760
But we found hope.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:34.640
Hope?

00:07:42.150 --> 00:07:47.610
The Book of Prophecies and the miraculous
"Gate" was discovered on the surface.

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:53.790
Using those things, we summoned
someone who could save this world...

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:57.580
And that's you, Lord Messiah!

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:03.340
So I got transferred from one stupid
alternate reality, Amuria, to another?!

00:08:03.340 --> 00:08:09.550
We must spread your gospel, Lord Messiah.
Please, come this way.

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:16.890
It's the Lord Messiah!

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.980
The Lord Messiah is really here!

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:21.060
Oh, thank the heavens!

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:24.320
Now we can finally leave this cave!

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:31.450
The people have been
waiting for your arrival.

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:36.040
A flock of losers who
can only rely on others...

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:38.250
This is a dump.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:46.630
They are all cooped up and have
no idea what to do. They deserve pity.

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:51.130
Please, Lord Messiah Ninomiya,
show them the way.

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:56.640
What are you talking about? It's your
world, you deal with your own crap.

00:08:56.640 --> 00:09:02.060
No, you will defeat the
Demon Lord for us, Lord Ninomiya.

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:09.320
You can't possibly choose
to abandon us, can you?

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:13.950
Dammit... Dropping the weak and pitiful
act and going straight to threats, huh?

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:19.040
But no matter what you say,
I have no desire to work for you...!

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:26.540
The Book of Prophecies also says...

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:33.510
When the Messiah faces the Demon Lord,
the road to "Japan" will be opened...

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:35.300
What...?

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:38.520
We have no idea where
this "Japan" place is, but...

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:45.020
It must be a sort of paradise for you,
isn't it, Lord Ninomiya...?

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:49.360
What do you think? Are you interested
in defeating the Demon Lord yet?

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:54.240
What a hollow act... That offer
was your play all along, wasn't it?

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:11.550
It looks like you're both ready to go!

00:10:11.550 --> 00:10:15.470
Your outfit... Don't tell me...

00:10:15.470 --> 00:10:20.100
Ranga will be accompanying you
on your journey as our priestess.

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:25.810
This airheaded girl seems
more like a burden than anything...

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:29.070
Oh, come on, Ninomiya. Don't say that!

00:10:29.070 --> 00:10:32.240
It's my pleasure to accompany you.

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:41.080
Oh no... My private parts...

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:43.830
You're... You're male!

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:46.290
The prophecy said that the child

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.670
with magical powers
must become the "priestess."

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:53.880
He was the only child in our town with any
magical powers, so we had no choice.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.680
Are you really taking this seriously?!

00:10:55.680 --> 00:11:00.220
Maybe this world is
doomed for a good reason!

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:02.310
Oh, did you get the wrong idea?

00:11:02.310 --> 00:11:05.230
But that's nobody's fault, really...

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:08.270
Tell you the truth,
nobody here is cuter than me.

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:13.320
Do try to keep your urges
under control, okay, Ninomiya?

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:17.700
Ugh, another troublemaker!

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:24.000
You messed up my hair! What gives?!

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:27.080
I'm not going to judge you
for your hobbies,

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:30.460
but if you want to play sexy, you need
to wait at least another 10 years.

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:40.510
It's settled then! I'll make you want me!

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:42.100
Whatever, brat.

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:45.770
The name is Ranga, not brat!

00:11:48.690 --> 00:11:52.650
Facing off against a "Demon Lord" in
another world, how absurd can this get...

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:55.280
But complaining won't get me anywhere.

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:57.820
All right... Here we go, brat!

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:11.880
Well, I'll be...

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:14.670
This isn't another separate world...

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:16.880
This is Amuria, in the future.

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:26.600
Who knew...

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:28.270
I knew they were exploitative,

00:12:28.270 --> 00:12:31.940
but I never thought Raiza'ha would
actually destroy the whole world.

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:36.570
They say it all started to go crazy after
someone named Belza became the leader.

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:43.370
Sounds about right. What a troublemaker,
building such a huge statue...

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:45.740
Hey, Ninomiya...

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:47.160
Hmm?

00:12:49.210 --> 00:12:50.290
No!

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:51.370
Oh no! We have to hurry, Ranga!

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:52.210
Huh?

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:55.590
Rim finished all the food at hand,
her eyes are looking really bad!

00:12:55.590 --> 00:12:58.880
That's the look of the beast
that's about to hunt us down!

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:00.380
Which way to the Demon Lord's castle?!

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:03.140
Hmm... Uh... Oh!

00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:08.140
That's it! That's the one!

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:09.850
That's the Demon Lord's castle!

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:10.890
Maybe...

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:12.600
Right!

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:24.990
Hungry...

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:30.790
This is the Demon Lord's castle...

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:33.830
Now, what to do...

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:36.460
I can't rely on Rim in her current state.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:40.260
We have to somehow get inside the castle
without the Demon Lord noticing...

00:13:40.260 --> 00:13:42.220
Then carefully gather information...

00:13:45.140 --> 00:13:46.680
Here we go!

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:54.440
What are you doing?!

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:57.900
It's "Operation:
Magic Go Boom," obviously.

00:13:57.900 --> 00:14:01.490
You want to meet the Demon Lord, right?
Let's go already!

00:14:02.990 --> 00:14:06.490
What do you think you're doing?!

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:11.910
Do you idiots realize this place
belongs to the Demon Lord Army's

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:14.120
esteemed deputy assistant section chief?

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:18.500
This is General Ant's town,
"General Ant Farm."

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:22.760
Hmm? "Deputy assistant section chief"?

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:23.970
Yeah!

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:26.090
"General Ant Farm"...?

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:27.680
Yes!

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:33.520
Hey, Ranga! This isn't the
Demon Lord's castle at all!

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:35.310
Oh? Really?

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:37.980
Did I take a wrong turn somewhere?

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:40.280
More importantly though, look!

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:41.610
Same "doo"!

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:44.030
Can I hit this one?

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:46.450
I would love to see that, but...

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:50.410
I can't right now! I have a goal...

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:53.580
There's no time to waste here!

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:55.540
Do it, Rim!

00:15:02.510 --> 00:15:06.590
--Who is this kid?!
--I'm hungry!

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:08.390
Our food!

00:15:08.390 --> 00:15:13.310
More! More food! Give me!

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:16.810
I'm truly sorry.

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:19.560
General Ant! Sir!

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:23.740
I brought you the suspicious individuals
who were making a scene at the north gate!

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:24.950
Wow, cool!

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:27.450
We got to meet someone
important-looking right away!

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:31.530
"Operation: Magic Go Boom"
is an obvious success, right, Ninomiya?

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:33.830
Shut up, dumb brat...

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:36.000
An intruder...

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:40.380
I don't expect humans to be able
to do any real harm at this point, but...

00:15:44.090 --> 00:15:47.340
I, General Ant, will not let
my guard down, not for an instant.

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:50.800
You shall be interrogated thoroughly
until I get my answers!

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:58.440
He doesn't have a title for nothing,
his pressure is intense...

00:15:58.440 --> 00:15:59.810
Wait, huh?

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:03.020
No way! Wow!

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:07.490
Mr. Ninomiya! It's you! It's Mr. Ninomiya!

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:10.700
Y-Yeah, that's me, but...

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:12.450
Who are you?

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:15.580
It's me! It's Ant A!

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:16.500
Seriously?!

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:17.460
Yes!

00:16:17.460 --> 00:16:19.710
Really? Ant A? The "Ant A"?!

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:24.130
Yes! The very same Ant A that
fought by your side, Mr. Ninomiya!

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:26.420
What's with the new look...?

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:30.970
I grew up as a monster,
and went up in rank, a little.

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:32.890
A little...?

00:16:32.890 --> 00:16:35.600
More like a lot! You're quite impressive.

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:38.100
Thank you, sir!

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:44.020
Ms. Rim does still
have her famous appetite.

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:48.780
What happened to the other ants?
Did they all grow up like you did?

00:16:48.780 --> 00:16:53.660
After you went missing,
we had our own troubles, too.

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:56.240
Most of our kind went
back underground, but...

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:59.830
Those who remained received
the blessing of the great Demon Lord.

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:04.790
Now we're able to walk proudly
on the surface to rule over humans.

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.300
I see...

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:08.800
I mean, it's been several hundred years,

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:12.590
but I remember the days spent
with you like it was yesterday.

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:16.310
I didn't know you were
so connected, Ninomiya. Respect.

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:21.140
Hey, your "Messiah" is fraternizing
with the Demon Lord's underling.

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:23.150
Don't you have anything to say about that?

00:17:23.150 --> 00:17:24.610
Nope.

00:17:24.610 --> 00:17:29.950
To be honest, I don't care at all about
anything, as long as I could get outside.

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:33.780
I was sick and tired of
that damp atmosphere...

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:35.620
And...

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:38.660
What?

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:40.410
Nope, nothing!

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:43.460
Hey, tell me more about the past!

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:46.210
Yes...

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:52.840
Back then, I was just a common
ant-type monster, but it was fun...

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:58.470
Following the lead of Mr. Ninomiya,
we faced off against impossible foes...

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:02.390
It was, how do you say, a passionate era.

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:06.980
Compared to that, nowadays, I'm just
stuck between a rock and a hard place.

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:06.980
Mmm. Delicious.

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:09.730
Did something happen?

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:11.280
The truth is...

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:18.540
General Ant!

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:24.210
Oh, what a mess. And what a waste.

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:26.170
My food...

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:28.130
What's going on?

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:31.010
Enough is enough, General Ant!

00:18:31.010 --> 00:18:33.800
I won't let you have your way any longer!

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:36.850
What do you think we humans are, you...

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:40.720
You. Will. Be. Punished.

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:49.230
Settle down, Rim.
Let's hear what he has to say.

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:51.190
So?

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:53.070
We've had enough!

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:53.820
Is that so?

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:57.780
We can't work for one second longer
in this horrible environment!

00:18:57.780 --> 00:18:59.120
Huh.

00:18:59.120 --> 00:19:04.210
Working 8 hours every day
with only two days of rest per week!

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:07.880
We can barely go out to have fun,
and waking up in the morning is so tough!

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:11.090
Besides, we're forced to buy
something called "insurance,"

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:14.420
some sort of scam about
being injured or getting sick!

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:19.050
They're trying to abuse us until we die!

00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:21.810
That's not exploitative in the slightest!

00:19:21.810 --> 00:19:25.100
What? What's this, Ninomiya?

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:31.400
Was this what you were
trying to tell me earlier?

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:34.190
We, the Ant race, after meeting
Mr. Ninomiya, were taught that

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:38.740
proper work must be rewarded
with proper compensation.

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:42.620
That's why we did our best
to give the humans a fair deal,

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:46.040
even though we did conquer them.

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:48.250
But they just...

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:50.750
They just won't work.

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:55.130
I don't know what to do!

00:19:56.010 --> 00:20:00.140
We're the backbone of the
Demon Lord Army's activities...

00:20:00.140 --> 00:20:05.770
Why don't you consult this Demon Lord
of yours? He's your big boss, right?

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:10.060
We can't. The Demon Lord
does not appear in public at all.

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:14.070
Only the highest-ranking officers
can hope to get an in-person meeting.

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:21.160
The only opportunity
is the board meeting...

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:24.450
Sounds like he's having a tough time, too.

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:27.040
But, yeah...

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:29.920
I thought all Demon Lords were,
like, slumped back on a throne,

00:20:29.920 --> 00:20:37.010
and go "Welcome interloper!"
to those who want to meet them, but...

00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:40.840
Right. I'll handle this.

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:41.890
Huh?

00:20:41.890 --> 00:20:47.980
I'll teach you how to achieve maximum
efficiency and maximum revenue.

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:50.690
Mr. Ninomiya...

00:20:51.230 --> 00:20:52.560
From that day on...

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:55.150
Mr. Ninomiya changed our name
from "General Ant Farm" to

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:58.360
"Dungeon Black Company: of the Future."

00:20:58.360 --> 00:21:01.360
He comprehensively overhauled
our corporate structure.

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:05.620
He first strengthened corporate oversight,

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:07.870
as if to fan the flames
of human dissatisfaction.

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:12.750
Disobedient humans
were punished relentlessly.

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:12.750
You like that? Want more?

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:14.000
Meanwhile...

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.210
Good work!

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:19.590
Thank you, sir!

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:23.800
Humans who behaved or performed
well were given small bonuses,

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:26.390
and the right to rule over other humans.

00:21:26.390 --> 00:21:30.020
A clear power structure was established
amongst the humans, and as a result...

00:21:30.020 --> 00:21:32.600
I love work!

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:35.570
Human pride, sense of inferiority,
and desire for recognition

00:21:35.570 --> 00:21:38.490
were put on display in a competitive
environment between humans.

00:21:38.490 --> 00:21:44.370
Many humans fought to devote
themselves deeper into their labor.

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:52.500
Sorry about this.

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:56.750
Turns out, I have more to gain from siding
with the Demon Lord's Army.

00:21:56.750 --> 00:22:00.880
I'm now the Demon Lord Army's
deputy assistant section chief,

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:02.220
and director of the new business
development division.

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.550
They call me "General Ninomiya" now.

00:22:05.550 --> 00:22:09.390
So. I've decided to rule this town now.

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:14.020
Don't worry. According to my calculations,

00:22:14.020 --> 00:22:16.730
you should end up about
three times more peaceful than before.

00:22:17.650 --> 00:22:19.190
My bad!
